# Types of Visualizations {.unnumbered}

## Distribution {.unnumbered}
### Boxplot {.unnumbered}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(ggplot2)
ggplot(data, aes(y=value))+
  geom_boxplot()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Basic Boxplot](Types_files/figure-html/basic-boxplot-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data, aes(y=value, x=group))+
  geom_boxplot()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Boxplot by Group](Types_files/figure-html/group-boxplot-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


### Violin {.unnumbered}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data, aes(x=group, y=value))+
  geom_violin()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Violin Plot by Group](Types_files/figure-html/violin-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


### Histogram {.unnumbered}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data, aes(x=value))+
  geom_histogram()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Basic Histogram](Types_files/figure-html/basic-histogram-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(data, aes(x=value))+
  geom_histogram(binwidth=.1)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Histogram with designated Bins](Types_files/figure-html/bin-histogram-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


